{"seq":2,"slug":"wo-wp-rvc-processing-rule","title":"WO/WP(归类改变)/RVC(价值成分)/加工工序标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preferential-origin-certificate/origin-criteria/wo-wp-rvc-processing-rule","wordCount":2052,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"wo-wp-归类改变-rvc-价值成分-加工工序标准\">WO/WP(归类改变)/RVC(价值成分)/加工工序标准</h1><p>协定附件里那几千行产品特定规则（Product Specific Rule, PSR），读起来像天书：<code>CTH; or RVC 40%</code>、<code>CC except Chapter 50 to 55</code>、<code>Manufacture from yarn</code>。但它们拆开只有四种判据，每一种都对应一个可编程的判定函数。看懂这四类标准的结构，是写判定引擎的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一个产品要获得原产资格，要么它「天生」就是原产的（完全获得），要么它在成员国境内经历了「足够的」加工。判断「足够」有四种互不相同的方法：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[产品特定规则 PSR] --&gt; B[完全获得 WO]&#10;  A --&gt; C[税则归类改变 CTC]&#10;  A --&gt; D[区域价值成分 RVC]&#10;  A --&gt; E[特定加工工序 SP]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[CC 章改变 前两位]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[CTH 品目改变 前四位]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[CTSH 子目改变 前六位]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[Build-down 扣减法]&#10;  D --&gt; D3[Build-up 累加法]&#10;  D --&gt; D4[MaxNOM 上限法]\">graph TD\n  A[产品特定规则 PSR] --&gt; B[完全获得 WO]\n  A --&gt; C[税则归类改变 CTC]\n  A --&gt; D[区域价值成分 RVC]\n  A --&gt; E[特定加工工序 SP]\n  C --&gt; C1[CC 章改变 前两位]\n  C --&gt; C2[CTH 品目改变 前四位]\n  C --&gt; C3[CTSH 子目改变 前六位]\n  D --&gt; D2[Build-down 扣减法]\n  D --&gt; D3[Build-up 累加法]\n  D --&gt; D4[MaxNOM 上限法]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>判定对象</th>\n<th>判定逻辑</th>\n<th>典型适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>WO 完全获得</td>\n<td>无进口投入的初级产品</td>\n<td>全部在成员境内获得</td>\n<td>农产品、矿产品、废碎料</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CTC 归类改变</td>\n<td>非原产材料的税号</td>\n<td>非原产材料税号不得与成品相同</td>\n<td>工业制成品主体规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RVC 区域价值成分</td>\n<td>价值构成</td>\n<td>区域内增值占比 ≥ 阈值</td>\n<td>化工、机械、汽车</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SP 加工工序</td>\n<td>生产过程的某一环节</td>\n<td>必须完成指定工序或从指定阶段起</td>\n<td>纺织、化学</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实际的 PSR 常常是组合形式，用 <code>or</code> 或 <code>and</code> 连接。<code>CTH or RVC 40%</code> 意味着满足任一条即可；某些化工规则写 <code>CTH and RVC 40%</code>，则必须同时满足。引擎必须把连接词解析成布尔表达式树，而不是简单取第一个条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"wo-完全获得的边界\">WO 完全获得的边界</h2><h3 id=\"典型类别\">典型类别</h3><p>完全获得适用于不使用任何进口材料的产品。欧盟规则体系列出的典型类别包括：在境内收获的植物、出生并饲养的活体动物、从土地或海床提取的矿物、制造过程产生的废碎料、以及仅由上述材料制成的产品（<a href=\"https://trade.ec.europa.eu/access-to-markets/en/content/goods-wholly-obtained\">EU Access2Markets: Products wholly obtained</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"渔业产品的特殊条件\">渔业产品的特殊条件</h3><p>鱼类有两套判定：在成员国领海内捕捞的自动原产；在领海外捕捞的，必须由悬挂该国国旗、在该国注册、且由该国国民或企业控股（至少 50%）的船舶捕获，某些情形还要求至少半数船员为该国国民。这是唯一一类「完全获得」却需要证明船舶资质的产品。</p>\n<h3 id=\"废碎料与再制造的边界\">废碎料与再制造的边界</h3><p>最容易出问题的不是农产品，而是废碎料。产品如果由回收的废旧物料制成，回收本身是否算「完全获得」是有条件的——废物必须在成员国境内产生，或从境内使用过的产品中回收。再制造与回收产品的原产地判定仍在演进，WCO 2026 年发布了相关研究（<a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/origin.aspx\">WCO Origin 专题</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"实现要点\">实现要点</h3><p>WO 判定在代码上很简单：检查 BOM 所有叶子节点是否都标记为「境内获得」。难的是数据——BOM 里一片空白和「全是境内料」语义完全不同，前者是未知，后者才是 WO。引擎必须用三值逻辑把「未知」当作不满足，详见 <a href=\"../origin-determination-data/bom-supplier-origin-data\">底层 BOM 与供应商原料原产数据采集</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ctc-归类改变的层级与陷阱\">CTC 归类改变的层级与陷阱</h2><h3 id=\"三个层级\">三个层级</h3><p>CTC 判定非原产材料是否发生了足够级别的税号跳跃，层级决定严格程度：<strong>CC</strong>（章改变）要求税号前两位变化，最严；<strong>CTH</strong>（品目改变）要求前四位变化；<strong>CTSH</strong>（子目改变）要求前六位变化。规则表中必须显式记录层级，因为「改变」二字单独出现时不可判定。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE psr_rule (&#10;  agreement        TEXT     NOT NULL,   -- &#39;RCEP&#39; / &#39;CPTPP&#39; / &#39;EU-VN&#39;&#10;  hs_prefix        TEXT     NOT NULL,   -- 适用本规则的 HS 前缀&#10;  prefix_level     SMALLINT NOT NULL,   -- 2/4/6，匹配精度&#10;  criterion_type   TEXT     NOT NULL,   -- &#39;WO&#39;|&#39;CTC&#39;|&#39;RVC&#39;|&#39;SP&#39;&#10;  ctc_level        SMALLINT,            -- 2=CC 4=CTH 6=CTSH，CTC 时必填&#10;  rvc_threshold    NUMERIC(5,2),        -- RVC 阈值，如 40.00&#10;  rvc_method       TEXT,                -- &#39;BUILD_DOWN&#39;|&#39;BUILD_UP&#39;|&#39;MAX_NOM&#39;&#10;  sp_text          TEXT,                -- 特定工序的自然语言描述&#10;  rule_group       SMALLINT NOT NULL,   -- 同组内 OR，跨组 AND&#10;  effective_from   DATE     NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_to     DATE,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (agreement, hs_prefix, prefix_level, rule_group, effective_from)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> psr_rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  agreement        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'RCEP' / 'CPTPP' / 'EU-VN'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hs_prefix        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 适用本规则的 HS 前缀</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prefix_level     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 2/4/6，匹配精度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  criterion_type   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'WO'|'CTC'|'RVC'|'SP'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctc_level        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 2=CC 4=CTH 6=CTSH，CTC 时必填</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rvc_threshold    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- RVC 阈值，如 40.00</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rvc_method       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'BUILD_DOWN'|'BUILD_UP'|'MAX_NOM'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sp_text          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 特定工序的自然语言描述</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_group       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 同组内 OR，跨组 AND</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (agreement, hs_prefix, prefix_level, rule_group, effective_from)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"比较对象是成品对材料\">比较对象是成品对材料</h3><p>反复踩的坑：比较对象是成品与每一件非原产材料，不是材料之间。一批成品的 HS 是 8518.30，某个非原产喇叭的 HS 是 8518.29——前四位相同，CTH 不成立，即便喇叭只占成品成本的 3%。这正是微小含量容忍存在的理由，见 <a href=\"accumulation-de-minimis-tolerance\">累积规则与微小含量容忍</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"全量扫描与例外清单\">全量扫描与例外清单</h3><p>CTC 必须逐件检查，任何一件失败即整体失败（除非触及 de minimis）。因此 CTC 判定天然是全量扫描，不能用「主要材料」做捷径优化。规则里的 <code>except</code> 子句（如 <code>CC except Chapter 50 to 55</code>）是例外清单，引擎必须先判定例外再判定主规则，顺序颠倒会得出相反结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rvc-的计算口径\">RVC 的计算口径</h2><h3 id=\"两种基本形式\">两种基本形式</h3><p>RVC 是四类标准里唯一需要算数的，也是口径分歧最大的一类。两个方向的公式通用：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>build-down</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>V</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>R</mi><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>build-up</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RVC_{\\text{build-down}} = \\frac{TV - VNM}{TV} \\times 100, \\qquad RVC_{\\text{build-up}} = \\frac{VOM}{TV} \\times 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">build-down</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">build-up</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是成交价格，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">VNM</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 是非原产材料价值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">VOM</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 是原产材料价值。USMCA 第 4.5 条给出的就是 <code>RVC = (TV − VNM) / TV × 100</code>，并允许改用净成本法 <code>RVC = (NC − VNM) / NC × 100</code>，两种方法的一般阈值分别是 60% 和 50%（<a href=\"https://www.international.gc.ca/trade-commerce/trade-agreements-accords-commerciaux/agr-acc/cusma-aceum/text-texte/04.aspx\">CUSMA/USMCA Chapter 4</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三种写法不能互转\">三种写法不能互转</h3><p>两个公式在数学上等价（当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>V</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TV = VOM + VNM</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 时），但工程上不等价，因为分母口径与价值调整规则不同。欧盟体系常用 <code>MaxNOM X% (EXW)</code> 形式——直接限制非原产材料占出厂价的比例，而不是算区域成分（<a href=\"https://trade.ec.europa.eu/access-to-markets/en/content/goods-sufficiently-transformed\">EU Access2Markets: goods sufficiently transformed</a>）。这三种必须分开存储，不能用一个布尔字段「是否满足 RVC」糊过去。</p>\n<h3 id=\"净成本法的剔除项\">净成本法的剔除项</h3><p>净成本法与成交价格法的差别在于分母剔除了什么。净成本要排除销售推广、市场营销、售后、特许权使用费、运输与包装成本，以及不允许的利息。这些调整项在 BOM 数据里通常不存在对应字段，需要独立的价格调整模块，其输入来自财务系统而非关务系统。</p>\n<h2 id=\"特定加工工序标准\">特定加工工序标准</h2><h3 id=\"锁定生产起点\">锁定生产起点</h3><p>特定工序规则直接规定「必须做什么」，不关心税号也不关心价值。纺织业是典型：规则可能要求「从纱线开始制造」（manufacture from yarn），意味着可以使用进口纱线但不能使用进口面料——它锁定了生产的起点阶段，而不是终点税号。</p>\n<h3 id=\"化学反应规则\">化学反应规则</h3><p>化工行业使用「化学反应规则」：只要在境内发生了指定类型的化学反应（而非简单混合），即视为足够加工。这类规则的难点是证据——税号可以从报关单读，价值可以从发票算，但「发生了酯化反应」需要生产工艺记录来证明，属于第二章数据采集的范围。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与-ctc-的方向差异\">与 CTC 的方向差异</h3><p>CTC 是否定式的（只要不对上号就行），特定工序是肯定式的（必须做出指定动作）。WTO 纪律要求原产地规则「基于肯定性标准」，特定工序是最纯粹的体现；CTC 虽是否定式表达，但因配以明确税号层级，实践中被接受。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组合规则的解析\">组合规则的解析</h2><h3 id=\"布尔表达式树\">布尔表达式树</h3><p>一条真实 PSR 可能写成 <code>CC; or CTH and RVC 35%</code>，运算符优先级与结合性必须按协定原意解析，不能想当然。引擎应把 PSR 解析成表达式树，求值时短路——<code>or</code> 左支为真即不再算右支，这既是性能优化也是行为正确性要求。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;hs&quot;: &quot;8518.30&quot;,&#10;  &quot;agreement&quot;: &quot;RCEP&quot;,&#10;  &quot;expression&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;op&quot;: &quot;OR&quot;,&#10;    &quot;operands&quot;: [&#10;      { &quot;op&quot;: &quot;CTC&quot;, &quot;level&quot;: 4 },&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;op&quot;: &quot;AND&quot;,&#10;        &quot;operands&quot;: [&#10;          { &quot;op&quot;: &quot;CTH&quot;, &quot;level&quot;: 4 },&#10;          { &quot;op&quot;: &quot;RVC&quot;, &quot;method&quot;: &quot;BUILD_DOWN&quot;, &quot;threshold&quot;: 35.0 }&#10;        ]&#10;      }&#10;    ]&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;effective_from&quot;: &quot;2026-01-01&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"hs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"8518.30\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"agreement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RCEP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"expression\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"OR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"operands\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CTC\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AND\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"operands\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CTH\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RVC\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"method\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BUILD_DOWN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"threshold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">35.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"effective_from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-01-01\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"备选规则的收益差异\">备选规则的收益差异</h3><p>多分支 PSR 的每个分支在工程上成本不同：CTC 分支只需归类数据，RVC 分支需要完整成本数据，SP 分支需要工艺记录。择优时应把「达成难度」当作成本，而非只挑阈值最低的分支——这条思路在第三章的最优选惠里会展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>四类判据 WO、CTC、RVC、SP，PSR 是它们的布尔组合，必须解析成表达式树。</li>\n<li>CTC 严格程度由层级决定 CC &gt; CTH &gt; CTSH，且必须逐件非原产材料检查。</li>\n<li>RVC 至少三种写法（build-down、build-up、MaxNOM），分母口径不同，必须分开建模。</li>\n<li>净成本法与成交价格法的差异在于分母剔除项，需要独立的价格调整模块。</li>\n<li>特定工序是肯定性标准，其证明依赖生产工艺记录而非报关数据。</li>\n<li>判定结果必须可回溯到具体条款；下一节讲如何用累积与微小含量把「差一点」的判定拉回合格，见 <a href=\"accumulation-de-minimis-tolerance\">累积规则与微小含量容忍</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"WO/WP(归类改变)/RVC(价值成分)/加工工序标准","id":"wo-wp-归类改变-rvc-价值成分-加工工序标准"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"WO 完全获得的边界","id":"wo-完全获得的边界"},{"level":3,"text":"典型类别","id":"典型类别"},{"level":3,"text":"渔业产品的特殊条件","id":"渔业产品的特殊条件"},{"level":3,"text":"废碎料与再制造的边界","id":"废碎料与再制造的边界"},{"level":3,"text":"实现要点","id":"实现要点"},{"level":2,"text":"CTC 归类改变的层级与陷阱","id":"ctc-归类改变的层级与陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"三个层级","id":"三个层级"},{"level":3,"text":"比较对象是成品对材料","id":"比较对象是成品对材料"},{"level":3,"text":"全量扫描与例外清单","id":"全量扫描与例外清单"},{"level":2,"text":"RVC 的计算口径","id":"rvc-的计算口径"},{"level":3,"text":"两种基本形式","id":"两种基本形式"},{"level":3,"text":"三种写法不能互转","id":"三种写法不能互转"},{"level":3,"text":"净成本法的剔除项","id":"净成本法的剔除项"},{"level":2,"text":"特定加工工序标准","id":"特定加工工序标准"},{"level":3,"text":"锁定生产起点","id":"锁定生产起点"},{"level":3,"text":"化学反应规则","id":"化学反应规则"},{"level":3,"text":"与 CTC 的方向差异","id":"与-ctc-的方向差异"},{"level":2,"text":"组合规则的解析","id":"组合规则的解析"},{"level":3,"text":"布尔表达式树","id":"布尔表达式树"},{"level":3,"text":"备选规则的收益差异","id":"备选规则的收益差异"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"优惠原产地与非优惠原产地","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preferential-origin-certificate/origin-criteria/preferential-vs-nonpreferential-origin"},"next":{"title":"累积规则与微小含量容忍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preferential-origin-certificate/origin-criteria/accumulation-de-minimis-tolerance"}}